// ====
// A nested reference capture transports the enclosing closure's complete SSA
// value when that closure cannot be represented in physical object storage.
// The inner call consumes the same ordinary value-receiver ABI as an explicit
// by-value capture; no pointer-bearing closure object is allocated.
